0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 13.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/07)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 14.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 06\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o evento Trilhos CDP 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no dia 6 de setembro de 2026 (Domingo), com partida junto \u00e0 Capela de S\u00e3o Sim\u00e3o, na Pedrulha, Coimbra.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Mini Trail 14 km tem partida marcada para as 09:30 e a Caminhada Colorida 7 km arranca \u00e0s 10:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal, brinde oficial, abastecimentos de percurso, refor\u00e7o final e almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio servido \u00e0s 12:30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O evento tem cariz solid\u00e1rio?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, por cada inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Caminhada Colorida a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o doa 2 \u20ac diretamente para causas solid\u00e1rias locais.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso fazer a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online nas plataformas TrilhosCDP.pt e BTT Manager at\u00e9 ao limite de vagas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trilhos CDP 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-06\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Largo e Capela de S\u00e3o Sim\u00e3o, Pedrulha\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Trilhos CDP \/ Clube Desportivo da Pedrulha\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o evento Trilhos CDP 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no dia 6 de setembro de 2026 (Domingo), com partida junto \u00e0 Capela de S\u00e3o Sim\u00e3o, na Pedrulha, Coimbra.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Mini Trail 14 km tem partida marcada para as 09:30 e a Caminhada Colorida 7 km arranca \u00e0s 10:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal, brinde oficial, abastecimentos de percurso, refor\u00e7o final e almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio servido \u00e0s 12:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O evento tem cariz solid\u00e1rio